### Get all orders

GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

### Get order with id

GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Create order

POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "ORDER-1001",
  "customer_id": 1,
  "amount": 39.98,
  "is_paid": false,
  "status_id": 1
}

### Update order

PUT http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "code": "ORDER-1001",
  "customer_id": 1,
  "amount": 39.98,
  "is_paid": false,
  "status_id": 1
}

### Delete order with id

DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/orders/1
Content-Type: application/json
